                                                "sense_id": "36ba6e9a-b1b2-31db-8aab-a536afa06fb8",
                                                "text": "San Jose Sharks defenseman Erik Karlsson successfully underwent surgery to fix a muscle tear in his left forearm, according to the team. Per the Sharks, Karlsson is expected to be reevaluated in March."
